    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d417">

                <pb facs="0499" n="395" xml:id="pg395"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.00 Revolutions/249: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at São Paulo</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cameron</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">São Paulo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1932-07-13T22:00:00-03:00">July 13, 1932—10
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 13—8:04 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Reliable information received in São Paulo that movement in Minas Geraes led by
                        Arthur Bernardes has deposed
                        Olegario Maciel and is favorable to São Paulo. This is
                    decisive.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cameron</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
